            <div xml:id="m-04fd21e7-cf67-4bed-b306-50a21bf1c06a">
              <lg xml:id="m-085da097-e10e-42c0-9a7f-5b7fff90ccef">
                <l xml:id="m-4bda8bfa-445d-4193-a57c-15a63ca6a492" facs="#m-1089a411-3645-43a9-b3eb-5dd9506b3eba" label="ambiguous">826</l><l xml:id="m-5aceca6a-6c0c-4145-b0c9-9eedb52621e1" facs="#m-1c56e6f1-4e43-4239-835f-000f9aa2639b" label="ambiguous">Ash Wednesday.</l><l xml:id="m-13ad13b7-5cb6-4416-a86e-ab897612e3b8" facs="#m-51f85133-c49b-465e-813a-230378dde110" label="lyrics-like">ré-re mé¬ i: * quó-ni-am in te confídit á-nima mé¬ a.</l><l xml:id="m-441224a7-14b2-4129-bc45-2481f5559ac6" facs="#m-094fac9a-5293-440f-921b-988e73c06a93" label="lyrics-like">Gló-ri-a Pátri. Eu o u a e. (Kyrie XVIII, p. 62).</l><l xml:id="m-2d3d3e8c-33f2-4e6c-bea6-5d29af3dd4a2" facs="#m-ec0385da-9be3-47c5-916b-a884403a0f94" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-0d0c3299-7afe-4681-bd2f-8fc362159f07" facs="#m-002ea31a-267d-4bfd-8488-ecb74725abbd" label="lyrics-like">Raesta Dómine fidélibus tuis: t ] piant, r et secúra devotióne percúr¬</l><l xml:id="m-0852afed-f170-4506-b2d1-39ce14b495ba" facs="#m-32f70abf-0b4f-4cbf-b675-6462630392cd" label="lyrics-like">ut jejuniórum veneránda sol-Irant. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-fb553899-120b-4e57-b4c9-d6d482d5e185" facs="#m-1589fd13-c61d-4c92-a9aa-3c11bd7291d5" label="lyrics-like">emnia, et cóngrua pietáte susci¬</l><l xml:id="m-2439f4b1-cd0a-4c76-9c6f-ccac9fc50166" facs="#m-627af029-6249-4d61-9b52-bc84dcde8adc" label="text-like">From Ash Wednesday to Passion Sunday exclusive, the following two</l><l xml:id="m-6a806702-65c9-4d89-8ea3-fc09d4400703" facs="#m-fca5c199-bed8-4ed0-8ef9-69594197b619" label="ambiguous">Collects are added:</l><l xml:id="m-8df6f3c7-3192-442b-a459-7f09ec00b08a" facs="#m-12238bc1-bdb8-44bd-b6dd-a0488a3393fe" label="text-like">and Collect. To implore the intercession of the Saints. A cunctis. p. 498.</l><l xml:id="m-c3712c26-4714-4d5a-8cd3-738ebbe955f1" facs="#m-f3232add-dbb1-4a00-84f0-8d404155f60e" label="text-like">Third Collect. For the living and the dead¬</l><l xml:id="m-1a908732-8829-4f1f-90dc-8580e0d4049c" facs="#m-b1d96684-5d1c-4d6e-abf3-8afbdaa8e301" label="lyrics-like">Mnípotens sempitérne Deus, qui saéculum adhuc in carne rétinet,</l><l xml:id="m-a5b54150-c463-45b1-97cd-e53842bbda5f" facs="#m-aedddbc9-e7c2-46a7-9185-f0f481bcaa38" label="lyrics-like">U vivórum domináris simui et vel futúrum jam exútos córpore</l><l xml:id="m-ce9ae77a-490f-40b8-bb34-acc910976335" facs="#m-ec344032-c8dd-420a-bd1f-a567beedf3f9" label="lyrics-like">suscépit, intercedéntibus ómnibus</l><l xml:id="m-ee9c5770-213d-419a-8623-03327efbe4e9" facs="#m-883ca9ca-bb00-429d-98c9-962e6d38cf5e" label="lyrics-like">mortuórum, omniúmque miseréris,</l><l xml:id="m-bb10377e-c3f8-45d3-b7ff-93208c67063f" facs="#m-db071f66-14fe-41a8-b027-2b4d9abee6c2" label="lyrics-like">quos tuos fide et ópere futúros esse</l><l xml:id="m-52cba04d-c095-4c04-b850-9b8a59e73d37" facs="#m-bcb81d36-b2ea-4d7c-a1b6-2c81fa5f8237" label="lyrics-like">sanctis tuis, pietátis tuae cleméntia,</l><l xml:id="m-d5f69c6c-819c-4b7c-a147-4638b22013f1" facs="#m-141dde68-7925-42ab-a24d-3a3ea21c4144" label="lyrics-like">praenóscis: te súpplices exorámus;</l><l xml:id="m-6d279a43-ca29-4f98-a706-e872d6182892" facs="#m-4f12da44-6d1a-426b-8f9c-18b412cc159b" label="lyrics-like">ómnium delictórum suórum véniam</l><l xml:id="m-b4b0aa2b-332f-467d-98a5-6b5e69e2f259" facs="#m-8508fc80-8fa6-40c3-b0e4-e543b485cd10" label="lyrics-like">consequántur. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-a52a12d1-d088-45a3-9c0a-c39c4ebb3a17" facs="#m-9c5c9f5e-9740-45d4-a5a5-1490dd1b263d" label="lyrics-like">ut, pro quibus effúndere preces de¬</l><l xml:id="m-f78e1108-43ea-4616-80e7-8b04f9736fe6" facs="#m-a6bceceb-50c4-4615-985e-754a13f1d949" label="lyrics-like">crévimus, quosque vel praesens</l><l xml:id="m-253b26ed-7ca6-47ec-8b25-16abbf2bc1e4" facs="#m-173e9fd6-ffb1-4205-a6ee-ff7ce91d8ae4" label="ambiguous">Lectio Joelis Prophetae. Joel. 2. c.</l><l xml:id="m-4b8992b6-3cde-4077-b9ce-ec508d9ef785" facs="#m-ac33f6a0-1012-42b1-a694-8e9f19141e01" label="lyrics-like">K Aec dicit Dóminus: Convertí- diátur sponsus de cubili suo, et</l><l xml:id="m-1a1d6307-12b0-4f08-8d10-a4d76f395fad" facs="#m-2210df6e-da6a-4e79-aec1-97f0f2dbe50a" label="ambiguous">It mini ad me in toto corde vestro,</l><l xml:id="m-57e6f4b4-79a4-467c-9d51-3627a274106e" facs="#m-ee21f620-fd0a-40db-9112-2b17c377230d" label="lyrics-like">sponsa de thálamo suo. Inter vesti¬</l><l xml:id="m-74ba7648-48b1-4605-a911-a9a692f9e2c0" facs="#m-76207ab1-5443-4c4a-ad55-dd26bd3b3e2d" label="lyrics-like">in jejúnio, et in fletu, et in planctu.</l><l xml:id="m-7fd237e8-ba0f-4644-8163-eb6565b7ec6a" facs="#m-734ea4c9-606e-4723-8699-425e66fe01e8" label="lyrics-like">bulum et altáre plorábunt sacerdó¬</l><l xml:id="m-6e65d692-27ce-414a-afc4-529f3358f441" facs="#m-8f1a7cd5-62a8-4932-aefd-7013416c4ebd" label="ambiguous">Et scindite corda vestra, et non ve¬</l><l xml:id="m-33f17862-e57d-4587-acac-c4e012692b2c" facs="#m-582cc76d-5656-4c47-a6cf-965f6dd24d9a" label="lyrics-like">tes ministri Dómini, et dicent: Par¬</l><l xml:id="m-31edfa6d-77da-4ab7-b0d6-5112df9dae4d" facs="#m-ce27c412-8c58-4e16-9827-32b25d395656" label="lyrics-like">stiménta vestra, et convertimini ad</l><l xml:id="m-01ef7937-65d7-49df-8864-59e8a0029759" facs="#m-7b3faf3c-96f5-4b6b-8923-be554a0f6d9c" label="lyrics-like">ce, Dómine, parce pópulo tuo: et</l><l xml:id="m-b364403d-052d-4a1a-8c8a-24f2031280b5" facs="#m-7c706b73-dac9-4ac6-8e5c-44ef6e76a9bb" label="lyrics-like">Dóminum Deum vestrum: quia</l><l xml:id="m-43641653-34b6-4855-9078-fef86206daf5" facs="#m-f32d850f-08c1-4237-bc20-17ec2410d76c" label="lyrics-like">ne des haereditátem tuam in oppró¬</l><l xml:id="m-2dde205e-08c9-41fa-8331-71e8a4e02125" facs="#m-939782b2-74e0-4d7d-8051-23b72937bb35" label="lyrics-like">benignus et miséricors est, pátiens,</l><l xml:id="m-8f44193d-59f5-4a86-9a91-3d1e7fec1474" facs="#m-5a001b44-8c4a-4d6c-a084-fa9981c46eab" label="lyrics-like">brium. ut dominéntur eis natiónes.</l><l xml:id="m-c0c066d5-ff90-4636-9b42-48eb8c0d9651" facs="#m-9f0a7840-3052-42cb-9646-08cf06b28a29" label="lyrics-like">et multae misericórdiae, et praestá¬</l><l xml:id="m-c65afa95-b80d-4adb-b880-1da86b535df8" facs="#m-50b0b156-7e50-4f34-8461-6c00747702aa" label="lyrics-like">Quare dicunt in pópulis: Ubi est</l><l xml:id="m-f9a28cca-7e5f-46b2-9f0c-5c5458e10f0e" facs="#m-f35e8e11-c94c-4d09-be90-81cb3fe0edf5" label="ambiguous">bilis super malitia. Quis scit, si con¬</l><l xml:id="m-96344155-661a-46c0-9be9-c2f193d63e37" facs="#m-b3f3afd1-c7d5-4f02-952c-eecca232f37e" label="lyrics-like">Deus eórum? Zelàtus est Dóminus</l><l xml:id="m-45cafe9c-24d4-47a5-9706-3fcf2815a2ff" facs="#m-f53de206-a77a-4f4a-8633-f4de01546b35" label="lyrics-like">vertátur, et ignóscat, et relinquat</l><l xml:id="m-36e19e09-2cb0-4842-9ad9-71850b297632" facs="#m-b723e702-7b1d-4135-93d6-99434e1efde5" label="lyrics-like">terram suam, et pepércit pópulo</l><l xml:id="m-b19494ea-2d69-4b6b-9421-480d102942c5" facs="#m-1d9e118f-6a9f-44d7-bdce-8c92db721f7a" label="lyrics-like">post se benedictiónem, sacrificium,</l><l xml:id="m-4cac14eb-e5a6-4705-bebf-f21a2789d901" facs="#m-2912ce93-0221-4c91-aa04-b290a2ae52cd" label="lyrics-like">suo. Et respóndit Dóminus, et dixit</l><l xml:id="m-9c9650f9-c54a-4a3f-91ff-86cf62ea696b" facs="#m-58006dd7-e34d-4be9-9b54-87f902ab515d" label="lyrics-like">et libámen Dómino Deo vestro?</l><l xml:id="m-7c7e9ec4-67e7-4a39-affe-6ebfd567d833" facs="#m-db0bd28f-27a1-4dff-b4f9-3edc49f0a4e5" label="lyrics-like">pópulo suo: Ecce ego mittam vobis</l><l xml:id="m-c1a03545-ba13-4cab-8973-fbb20e00a1a6" facs="#m-dfe86372-c86a-4297-ae28-bf29fc523021" label="lyrics-like">Cánite tuba in Sion, sanctificáte</l><l xml:id="m-ef380c98-21b1-47ec-894d-d1312bf7de29" facs="#m-13ff66cc-092e-4fa6-b846-07736b834a61" label="lyrics-like">fruméntum, et vinum, et óleum, et</l><l xml:id="m-a0b3800d-0b1a-4bb9-9384-b5506ea5aee4" facs="#m-0cad9d3e-eb7c-4913-978b-e40eea90e902" label="lyrics-like">replebímini eis: et non dabo vos</l><l xml:id="m-9578cefb-fcf0-49aa-aedf-ab0532c75acd" facs="#m-a5d2fb25-8a88-4078-952e-9d4cc43e6fc2" label="lyrics-like">jejúnium, vocáte coetum, congre¬</l><l xml:id="m-47b7dd1d-53c0-404f-916a-2f1b31f54545" facs="#m-56da6f5d-1863-4304-8ebc-6531365b8dad" label="lyrics-like">gáte pópulum, sanctificáte Ecclé¬</l><l xml:id="m-b079b05e-9169-47b3-971f-4376fca33fa1" facs="#m-4508dcba-48c9-4285-a3e6-18d0bc2e956a" label="lyrics-like">ultra oppróbrium in géntibus: dicit</l><l xml:id="m-1adec6f3-4878-4795-99cb-9c568d5162d2" facs="#m-89963545-ddfe-4610-b722-6694b9450580" label="lyrics-like">Dóminus omnípotens.</l><l xml:id="m-b0d73b2b-2712-40ae-b156-07bcd4825f76" facs="#m-a09c86bd-f455-42e6-a455-4ec17d108997" label="lyrics-like">siam, coadunáte senes, congregáte</l><l xml:id="m-437cad40-d340-429e-adb2-de7dcb964427" facs="#m-784fa76a-9cc0-406b-8254-cc02ff07f09d" label="lyrics-like">párvulos, et sugéntes úbera : egre¬</l><l xml:id="m-805aee23-3643-4ef7-b968-6d68df52c524" facs="#m-9f0bdfa1-f370-4c67-b3c2-f36e33cdd933" label="ambiguous">crad.</l><l xml:id="m-dd7cd7a9-ad09-44c2-8d90-b997241ee7c9" facs="#m-7ae178e4-45f8-41e4-844a-21d0e13613fe" label="ambiguous">1.</l><l xml:id="m-72e59daa-2236-406e-b0fb-2a7c0c720750" facs="#m-98b72f89-52b9-41f1-80ba-f29ec136bb0a" label="lyrics-like">Il Ise- rére? mé¬</l><l xml:id="m-a6971ec1-f55d-441e-9549-8e06cb832e1d" facs="#m-9baff5f6-e7de-4387-85fc-26a3155a3389" label="lyrics-like">i Dé-us,</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>